    <string-array name="wehavephones_overlay_tips">
        <item>Battle.net keeps you signed in when you tick \"Keep me logged in\" in its sign-in window.</item>
        <item>Tap Show screen at any time to see what is happening behind this screen.</item>
        <item>Battle.net closes once WoW starts, to free memory.</item>
        <item>Lower game resolutions in Settings leave more memory for WoW.</item>
        <item>Diagnostics in the menu shows memory, the runtime and the Wine logs.</item>
    </string-array>
